 "remarks": "Studio Apartment for Rent - Prime Spring Hill Location! Excellent location directly across from Norwalk Hospital, with convenient access to public transportation! This newly refreshed studio offers a generously sized main living area with plenty of room for a bed, sofa, and TV. Features include an updated galley-style kitchen, a large closet, and a private, updated bathroom with a stall shower. One assigned parking space is included (electronic charging available), with additional street parking available. Enjoy the convenience of nearby delis, restaurants, a barber shop, laundromat, and liquor store, all within walking distance. A great opportunity to enjoy comfortable, convenient living in a desirable Spring Hill location! Schedule your private showing today!",
